    "detailed_description": "<strong>The girl starts running, to change her fate.</strong><br><br>A simple yet rhythmic 2D side-scrolling casual action game!<br>Vivian, the girl, keeps running with a certain goal in mind.<br>Match the right actions (button operations) with the music as you follow the path of light and race through the collapsing fantasy world to reach the goal.<br><br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027900/extras/96cbeb23b9453ecaf6355a03f6a23a55.avif?t=1722567174\" width=490 height=698 /></span><br><br>Vivian, the girl.<br>She doesn\u2019t know much about herself.<br>When she became aware, she found herself in a dark place, always undergoing some kind of experiment.<br>Now, she just runs.<br>For what purpose?<br>For whom?<br>No one asks, and she wouldn\u2019t answer if they did.<br>With only one firm belief, she keeps running.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027900/extras/13aadcf81f3e9dd48c9e0e36dfaca031.avif?t=1722567174\" width=602 height=336 /></span><br><br>Manga artist Imomushi Narita has turned the story of the character &quot;Vivian,&quot; a supporting character from his work Killing Me/Killing You, into a game, continuing her story. Of course, you can enjoy playing the game even if you're not familiar with the manga. (If you\u2019re interested, buy the manga too!)<br><br><i>Please note that this is an early access demo version, and only Stage 1 is playable.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The girl starts running, to change her fate.</strong><br><br>A simple yet rhythmic 2D side-scrolling casual action game!<br>Vivian, the girl, keeps running with a certain goal in mind.<br>Match the right actions (button operations) with the music as you follow the path of light and race through the collapsing fantasy world to reach the goal.<br><br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027900/extras/96cbeb23b9453ecaf6355a03f6a23a55.avif?t=1722567174\" width=490 height=698 /></span><br><br>Vivian, the girl.<br>She doesn\u2019t know much about herself.<br>When she became aware, she found herself in a dark place, always undergoing some kind of experiment.<br>Now, she just runs.<br>For what purpose?<br>For whom?<br>No one asks, and she wouldn\u2019t answer if they did.<br>With only one firm belief, she keeps running.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027900/extras/13aadcf81f3e9dd48c9e0e36dfaca031.avif?t=1722567174\" width=602 height=336 /></span><br><br>Manga artist Imomushi Narita has turned the story of the character &quot;Vivian,&quot; a supporting character from his work Killing Me/Killing You, into a game, continuing her story. Of course, you can enjoy playing the game even if you're not familiar with the manga. (If you\u2019re interested, buy the manga too!)<br><br><i>Please note that this is an early access demo version, and only Stage 1 is playable.</i>",
